    "summary": "Use it as the opponent's Charge phase ends, on 1 unengaged friendly unit that is within 12″ of an enemy unit; a **VEHICLE** qualifies only if it is also a **CHARACTER** or **WALKER**. Pick a mode as you pay, before the charge roll, then resolve a charge with that unit ([Charge Step](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)):\n\n- **Leap to Defend** (1 CP): charge targets may only be enemy units in reach that charged this phase.\n- **Into the Fray** (2 CP): a charge roll above 6 after modifiers becomes 6, and charge targets may be any enemy units that pass 2 tests: within 6″ and in reach of the roll.\n\nCP modifiers apply to the chosen mode's full cost.",
